I can certainly recommend having a strong pet for an inexperienced 
player, however, one that eats (and thus remains tame) and doesn't
summon nasties and doesn't teleport to you is much better.  A dragon or 
master mind flayer are excellent pets.  It's just too easy to
mess up with a lich.


